about:()=>["About | HighServiceDemand","Why HighServiceDemand exists, what we do for homeowners and businesses, and where we are headed.",H("h1","Our story","Every home has a story.<br>We help it get fixed.","Why we built HighServiceDemand, what we do, and the future we are working toward.")+
SEC("",`<div class="cg"><div><span class="eb">The problem</span><h2>Picture a homeowner at 2 a.m.</h2><p>Water is running down the wall. Their phone is in their hand, their heart is racing, and the search results are a wall of ads, unknown names and reviews they cannot trust. They do not need ten options. They need one good person to pick up and help.</p><p>Too often they get the opposite: a dozen sales calls, a pushy quote, or a job done badly with nobody to turn to afterwards. A home is the biggest thing most families will ever own. Fixing it should not feel like a gamble.</p></div><div><span class="eb">The other side</span><h2>Now picture a contractor on a quiet Tuesday</h2><p>The trucks are loaded and the crew is ready. The phone does not ring. Or it rings with leads that were sold to five other companies, so every call starts as a race to the lowest price.</p><p>Good tradespeople spend their lives mastering a craft. They should not have to spend their days chasing strangers and paying for calls that were never really theirs.</p></div></div>`)+
SEC("soft",`<span class="eb">What we do</span><h2>We connect the two, and we stand behind it</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h3>For homeowners</h3><p>Call us or send a request. We pass it to one independent local pro who calls you back. It is free, there is no account, and you are never obliged to hire.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>For businesses</h3><p>Exclusive calls from homeowners who are ready to talk, in your trade and your area. Prices are published, you pay for valid calls only, and there are no contracts.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Best Job Guarantee</h3><p>If a job is not done to your satisfaction, we find you another contractor to fix the problem at no additional cost to you.</p></div></div>`)+
SEC("",`<div class="cg"><div><span class="eb">Our purpose</span><h2>Make hiring help at home feel safe</h2><p>We exist so that the person with the leak, the broken heater or the storm-damaged roof can make one call and know someone good is on the way. And so that the people who do this work well are rewarded with a steady line of real customers.</p></div><div><span class="eb">Our vision</span><h2>A trusted pro for every home</h2><p>We see a country where nobody lies awake wondering who to call, and where every honest local business has the work it deserves. Fewer middlemen, clearer prices, better jobs, and homes that are cared for.</p></div></div>`)+
SEC("soft",`<span class="eb">What we stand for</span><h2>Four promises</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h3>One call, one pro</h3><p>Your request goes to one business, not a crowd.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Plain pricing</h3><p>No hidden fees for anyone, on either side of the call.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Accountability</h3><p>If the work falls short, we help make it right.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Respect for craft</h3><p>We back local tradespeople who show up and do it properly.</p></div></div>`)+
SEC("",`<div class="grid hs"><div class="card hsc"><div class="big">80k+</div><p><b>clients served</b></p></div><div class="card hsc"><div class="big">4.7</div><span class="st47" role="img" aria-label="4.7 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span><p><b>average review score</b></p></div><div class="card hsc"><div class="big">9</div><p><b>home service trades covered</b></p></div></div>`)+
`<div class="band"><div class="w"><h2>Your home deserves a good call</h2><p>Homeowners, call or request a free match. Contractors, see how exclusive calls work.</p><div class="b" style="display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center">${CALLBIG()}${RQ("ghost")}<a class="btn navy" href="/pros/">For contractors</a></div></div></div>`],
